    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nForkin Earls Property are delighted to present No. 36 Tuskar Courtyard to the market. This well-presented one-bedroom ground floor apartment is ideally positioned within the highly sought-after Marina Village development on the north side of Arklow Town. Offering approximately 51 sq.m. (549 sq.ft.) of well-designed accommodation, this attractive home enjoys a superb riverside setting within walking distance of every local amenity.\n\nPerfectly positioned in the heart of Arklow Marina Village, this prime location offers an exceptional lifestyle where residents enjoy a host of amenities right on their doorstep. The beach, Bridgewater Shopping Centre, cinema, supermarkets, cafés, schools, sports facilities, restaurants, bars, leisure facilities, harbour, river walks, sailing club, golf club, bus & rail services and Arklow's vibrant Main Street are all within easy walking distance, allowing you to enjoy the perfect balance of coastal living and everyday convenience.\n\nInternally, No. 36 is presented in excellent condition throughout and offers bright, comfortable accommodation. The layout briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, a generous double bedroom with fitted wardrobes, and a well-appointed bathroom. The apartment further benefits from direct access to the beautifully maintained communal grounds, providing a pleasant outdoor setting for residents to enjoy.\n\nArklow Marina Village is an exclusive, electrically gated private development comprising a selection of quality apartments, duplexes and penthouses. Designed as a low-density waterfront development, the scheme features attractive water features, landscaped gardens and well-maintained courtyards, creating a peaceful and secure residential environment within easy reach of Arklow Town Centre.\n\nCombining a superb location, excellent condition and well-designed accommodation, No. 36 Tuskar Courtyard represents an outstanding opportunity to acquire a quality home in one of Arklow's most desirable residential developments. Whether seeking a first home, a low-maintenance property, a suitable option for downsizing, or a valuable addition to an investment portfolio, this impressive apartment is sure to appeal.\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 3.92m x 5.06m\nA bright and welcoming entrance hallway featuring laminate wooden flooring and neutral décor, creating a light and airy first impression. The hallway provides access to the main living accommodation while offering a practical space for everyday use.\n\nLiving/Dining - 4.07m x 5.88m\nA bright and spacious open-plan living and dining room, enhanced by three tall front-facing windows that flood the space with natural light. Finished with laminate wooden flooring and centred around an attractive feature fireplace with a timber surround and polished stone hearth, this versatile room provides an ideal setting for both relaxing and entertaining.\n\nKitchen - 2.30m x 1.94m\nLocated just off the living/dining room, the well-appointed fitted kitchen offers a practical and functional layout. It features a range of wall and floor-mounted units, tiled splashback, generous worktop space, an integrated oven, four-ring gas hob with extractor hood, stainless steel sink, and is plumbed for both a washing machine and dishwasher. Finished with tiled flooring, the kitchen provides excellent storage, and everything required for everyday cooking and convenience.\n\nBedroom - 4.83m x 3.63m\nA bright and well-proportioned double bedroom finished with laminate wooden flooring and a neutral colour palette. Offering ample space for freestanding furniture, this comfortable room provides a blank canvas for a purchaser to personalise to their own taste.\n\nBathroom - 1.79m x 0.90m\nA well-proportioned bathroom comprising a corner shower enclosure with an electric shower, WC and pedestal wash hand basin. The room is finished with tiled flooring, partially tiled walls and a fitted wall-mounted mirror, providing a practical and functional space for everyday use.\n\nDirections - \nFrom Dublin travelling south on the N11, turn off at junction No 20 (sign posted Arklow North). Proceed into Arklow Town and take the left turn at the roundabout just before the bridge. Proceed down the quay (Pass the Bridgewater Shopping centre) and the Marina Village is on the left. Proceed in through the main electric gated entrance & walk through the courtyard of the first block which is to the left and No. 36 Tuskar is in the corner on the right.\n\nServices - \nNatural Gas-fired central heating.Mains Water, Sewage and Electricity.Fibre Internet, Telephone, and Satellite in the area.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Excellent one-bedroom, ground-floor apartment extending to approximately 51 sq. m. (549 sq. ft.).</li><li> Superb waterfront setting within the highly sought-after Arklow Marina Village, an exclusive private residential development featuring an electrically gated entrance and secure resident parking.</li><li> Beautifully maintained communal grounds with landscaped gardens and attractive water features.</li><li> Picturesque riverside walks and an excellent selection of coastal amenities on the doorstep, including the beach, harbour, marina and sailing club.</li><li> Outstanding range of amenities within easy walking distance, including Bridgewater Shopping Centre, Arklow Town Centre, cinema, supermarkets, cafes, restaurants, bars, hotels, leisure facilities, golf club, swimming pool, athletic track and leisure centre.</li><li> Excellent transport connections, with Dublin and Wexford both less than an hour's drive away. The M11 motorway is easily accessible, while Arklow's bus and rail services are located nearby.</li><li> Arklow Marina Village is one of the town's most prestigious residential addresses, comprising a private enclave of high-quality apartments, duplexes and penthouses set within an attractive, low-density waterfront environment.</li><li> An ideal property for a wide range of buyers, including first-time buyers, downsizers, those seeking a low-maintenance home, or investors.</ul>"
      },
